<script>
let { solution = null, lesson = null, reflection = '' } = $props();
const options = [['own','自己想到了这个方向'],['hint','提示帮我找到了方向'],['learn','看懂了，想再练一题']];
</script>
<div class="tabs" id="solutionTabs">{#each solution?.tabs ?? [] as tab}<button class="tab" class:active={tab.active} data-solution={tab.index}>{tab.label}</button>{/each}</div>
<div id="solutionBody">{#if solution}<div class="equation">{solution.equation}</div><p class="strategy">{solution.strategy}</p><div class="steps">{#each solution.steps as step, i}<div class="step"><span class="num">{i+1}</span><strong>{step.equation}</strong><p>{step.caption}</p></div>{/each}</div>{/if}</div>
<section class="lesson"><div id="lessonBody">{#if lesson}<div class="lesson-kicker">{lesson.wrong?'沿着参考解法找规律':'把这一题，变成下一题的经验'}</div><div class="method-tags">{#each lesson.methods as method}<button data-method={method.id}>{method.icon} {method.name}</button>{/each}</div><div class="lesson-grid"><div><b>① 从哪里想到？</b><p>{lesson.find}</p></div><div><b>② 为什么能行？</b><p>{lesson.why}</p></div><div><b>③ 下次怎么用？</b><p>{lesson.next}</p></div></div><p class="lesson-trap">小心这个坑：{lesson.trap}</p><div class="lesson-actions"><button class="primary" data-practice={lesson.primary}>换一道，练「{lesson.name}」 →</button><button class="ghost" data-method={lesson.primary}>打开方法手册</button></div><p class="fineprint">这是本解法体现的方法，不是本题唯一的解题套路。同一个算式也可能同时用到几种方法。</p>{/if}</div><div class="reflection" id="reflection"><strong>停三秒，把收获留下来</strong><p>这次，你是怎么找到思路的？</p><div class="reflection-options">{#each options as [key,label]}<button class="tab" class:active={reflection===key} data-reflection={key} aria-pressed={reflection===key}>{label}</button>{/each}</div><p class="reflection-response" aria-live="polite">{reflection==='own'?'记住触发灵感的那个线索，下次先找它。':reflection==='hint'?'把提示变成自己的问题：“我还缺哪一个搭档？”':reflection==='learn'?'看懂是第一步。点“换一道”，不看答案再试一次。':'只记录你的学习感受，不影响星星。'}</p></div></section>
